Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dotfiles/notmuch: Check that the mail commands are
 installed
To: lab@lists.p7x.dev
Cc: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Change-Id: ykxvquumrkourmwkqsmktssryqwmktpo
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 04:27:04 +0000

just check hides each command's output and reports only its exit
status. On a host without mbsync, msmtp, or notmuch, every check that
runs one fails, and nothing says the command is missing, so the result
looks like a broken config rather than a missing package.

Report each command first, and stop if any is missing, with the pkg
install line that provides it. The remaining checks only mean
something once the commands are present.
---
