+=just check= checks this login's setup. It first checks that mbsync,
+msmtp, and notmuch are installed. If any is missing, it names the
+packages and stops, since the other checks would only fail without
+saying why:
+#+BEGIN_EXAMPLE
+pkg install isync msmtp notmuch
+#+END_EXAMPLE
+
+Then it checks that mbsync logs in and lists the list's folders, that
+a dry run of the sync works, that the profile has its config, hooks,
+and database, and that msmtp reaches lab-mail and posts from the
+profile's address. It prints one line per check, ok or FAIL, and
+exits non-zero if any fails. It changes nothing and posts no mail, so
+it is safe to run at any time.
 
